Package: sdtmai
Type: Package
Title: Minimal AI-Assisted SDTM Mapping Proof of Concept
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ClinicalAI", "SDTM POC Team", email = "noreply@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates draft, programmer-reviewable SDTM mappings for domains
    available in a supplied SDTMIG workbook, using approved study metadata,
    selected study context, and an OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Deterministic
    programmer-review validation supports the same workbook domains. This
    exploratory proof of concept generates R transformation code for one
    approved SDTM domain per mapping file and does not execute generated code or
    SDTM datasets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    haven,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    officer,
    readr,
    readxl,
    yaml
